    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was reincarnated as an extra character in the magical girl anime that my niece loved to watch.<br>In this world where stones replace people, I thought if I avoided getting involved with anyone and made it to the end, I could return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Come forth. I have something important to say to you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final boss showed up at my house, even though I never gave him my address.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ugh, fine. Yeah, I quit. Isn't it about time I quit? I'm tired and fed up.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist suddenly quit being a magical girl and holed up in her house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s even going on? I just want to go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This world is doomed.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought that as I looked at the situation around me. I didn\u2019t want to do anything, just kill time until I could go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You want to go home, don\u2019t you? Let\u2019s save the world together.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time traveler, who didn\u2019t exist in the original story, appeared. He said if I wanted to go home, I\u2019d have to help him save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Trust me. If you can\u2019t trust me, at least trust the name \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He even knows my niece\u2019s name, who doesn\u2019t exist in this world?<br>If saving the world is the only way to go home, then maybe I should give it a try.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was reincarnated as an extra character in the magical girl anime that my niece loved to watch.<br>In this world where stones replace people, I thought if I avoided getting involved with anyone and made it to the end, I could return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Come forth. I have something important to say to you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final boss showed up at my house, even though I never gave him my address.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ugh, fine. Yeah, I quit. Isn't it about time I quit? I'm tired and fed up.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist suddenly quit being a magical girl and holed up in her house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s even going on? I just want to go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This world is doomed.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought that as I looked at the situation around me. I didn\u2019t want to do anything, just kill time until I could go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You want to go home, don\u2019t you? Let\u2019s save the world together.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time traveler, who didn\u2019t exist in the original story, appeared. He said if I wanted to go home, I\u2019d have to help him save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Trust me. If you can\u2019t trust me, at least trust the name \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He even knows my niece\u2019s name, who doesn\u2019t exist in this world?<br>If saving the world is the only way to go home, then maybe I should give it a try.</p>",
    "short_description": "One day, the protagonist was reincarnated into the world of a magical girl anime that his niece loved to watch. However, disappointed by the strange situation where everyone around him looked like stones, the protagonist tries to live a normal life but constantly gets caught up in events.",
